00:04:46.000 --> 00:05:20.000
And there we saw a very spread out distribution. So the most common responses were 100 and zero, but then it was really. out, really spread out in between, and the average was 46%. What that's telling me is, you know, some people are liking it, some aren't. I think for most people, they're seeing working remote some at the time would be nice, but this 100% has some downsides, probably largely in terms of, you know, social isolation, not feeling like you get out of a house ever. So let's shift gears for a minute to talk about telework more broadly.
在那里我们看到了一个非常分散的分布。最常见的回答是100%和0%，但中间的分布非常广，平均值为46%。这告诉我的情况是，你知道，有些人喜欢它，有些人不喜欢。我认为对大多数人来说，他们认为部分时间远程工作会很好，但100%远程工作有一些缺点，可能主要是在社会孤立方面，感觉永远无法走出家门。那么让我们换个话题，谈谈更广泛的远程办公。

