is it teleworking that's causing you to be more or less productive. But there was one really solid experiment out there. And they found it was in a call center and they found that the workers who worked from home made significantly more calls every day. They actually worked longer hours. But the quality of their calls were just as high as they were before. So suggesting people are more efficient, I think, from home, which is, in a lot of cases, I would say largely because you're not being interrupted by coworkers in the noisy environment of the office. Now, of course, COVID's a little bit different because people have kids at home, so they may have interruptions if they wouldn't under a normal remote work arrangement where they would have child care.
是远程办公导致你生产力更高还是更低的最佳方式。但有一个非常扎实的实验。他们发现是在一个呼叫中心，他们发现居家办公的员工每天拨打的电话数量明显更多。他们实际上工作的时间更长。但他们的通话质量和以前一样高。这表明人们在家办公效率更高，我认为，在很多情况下，这主要是因为你不会被办公室嘈杂环境中的同事打断。当然，新冠疫情有点不同，因为人们有孩子在家，所以如果他们没有像正常远程工作安排那样有托儿服务，他们可能会受到干扰。

