Before the COVID-19 pandemic, some early adopters, including Best Buy, IBM and Yachter, were reversing policies that allowed employees to telecommute. They cited leadership changes in a growing need for a creative collaboration. Do you think that these companies will continue on that path once the emergency is over? Yeah, those are really interesting, especially Best Buy, because they had been really progressive, actually, in allowing people to work however or wherever. And then I was surprised to see them roll that back because the data actually, at least the data that was published suggested that was working. But I think moving forward, based on what I'm seeing, just in informal discussions as well as in headlines, I think a lot of companies are going to become much more open to remote work.
在新冠疫情之前，一些早期采用者，包括百思买、IBM和雅虎，正在撤销允许员工远程办公的政策。他们提到了领导层的变动和对创造性协作日益增长的需求。你认为这些公司在紧急情况结束后会继续走这条路吗？是的，这些非常有趣，尤其是百思买，因为他们实际上在允许人们以任何方式或在任何地方工作方面非常进步。然后我很惊讶地看到他们撤回了这一点，因为数据实际上，至少已发表的数据表明那是有效的。但我认为展望未来，根据我所看到的，无论是在非正式讨论中还是在头条新闻中，我认为很多公司将变得对远程工作更加开放。

12
00:07:32.000 --> 00:08:17.000
I think it's going to be important for recruitment and retaining people in the workforce now that a lot of people have gotten a taste for it. I think a lot of employees are going to sort of demand it and want a workforce to allow that. And there's also a lot of benefits from a cost-saving standpoint. You don't have to have as much office space so you can save on real estate. And you can also, if you have a fully remote workforce, you can recruit from anywhere in the world, which really puts you an advantage in trying to get top talent. So I'm projecting, you know, there's no way really to know, but I think we will see more of a shift to remote work moving forward. Is teleworking equally good for everyone? Is there some kind of a profile of the person who thrives and the person who really struggles?
我认为这对招聘和留住劳动力很重要，因为现在很多人已经尝到了甜头。我认为很多员工会要求这样做，并希望劳动力能够实现这一点。而且从节省成本的角度来看，也有很多好处。你不需要那么多的办公空间，所以你可以节省房地产成本。而且，如果你拥有全职远程办公的员工队伍，你可以在世界任何地方招聘，这在争取顶尖人才方面确实让你处于优势。所以我预测，你知道，虽然没有办法真正知道，但我认为未来我们会看到更多向远程工作的转变。远程办公对每个人都同样好吗？是否存在某种适合远程办公的人和真正挣扎的人的画像？

