Yeah, that's a great question. And that was one of the things we're trying to uncover in our grant and our rapid grant because there's hardly any research out there at all on the topic. I think there's one study that looked at personality. But other than that, there's a lot to be done. So we're exploring different personality variables in our dataset. We're also exploring things like family structure, the way that you like to manage work in family. Because if you're someone who really likes to keep them separate, obviously working from home, does not allow you to do that.
是的，这是一个很好的问题。这也是我们在我们的资助和快速资助中试图揭示的事情之一，因为关于这个主题几乎没有任何研究。我想有一项研究关注了人格。但除此之外，还有很多工作要做。所以我们正在探索我们数据集中的不同人格变量。我们还在探索家庭结构、你喜欢管理工作和家庭的方式等因素。因为如果你是一个真正喜欢将它们分开的人，显然在家工作并不能让你做到这一点。

